# Package F "A Holiday on Ice": Morrow has the key to the stash (holiday_on_ice_stash) that holds the pump specs.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('holiday_on_ice_bribed')
goto: Bribed

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: I have a meeting. Is this about the inspection?
#
o_text: (Technology) I'm the inspection. Your pump design leaks heat at the third stage. Show me the specs.
o_id: holiday_on_ice_talk
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(holiday_on_ice)') && !HasItem('holiday_on_ice_stash_key')
o_test: RollSkill('technology', 'Hard')
o_succ: Yield
o_fail: Refuse
#
o_text: Somebody's paying to steal your specs. I could warn you for a price.
o_id: holiday_on_ice_bribe
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(holiday_on_ice)') && !HasItem('pump_specs') && !HasFlag('holiday_on_ice_paid')
o_goto: Bribe
#
o_text: What do the pumps cool?
o_id: holiday_on_ice_lore
o_goto: Lore
#
o_text: Bye.
o_id: holiday_on_ice_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: Lore
npc: Cold units. For the ships, they say. Thousands of them. Big enough for a person, if you ask me. Nobody asks me.
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: holiday_on_ice_lore_back
o_goto: Default

name: Yield
npc: (He goes red.) Third stage, yes. How did you... Here, the key, take the specs, review them. I need this signed off.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'holiday_on_ice_stash_key', 1)
effect: EndConversation

name: Refuse
npc: You're not an inspector. Security!
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribe
npc: (He sweats.) Two-fifty. Don't tell security I was careless. Please.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 250)
effect: SetFlag('holiday_on_ice_bribed')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: I changed the lock. Thank you.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Excuse me.
effect: EndConversation
